Xiaohongshu Local MVP

This local adapter references public page selectors and note data structures from
xpzouying/xiaohongshu-mcp, tag v2.5.5, commit
a5c8f7799980ba1fdd501999843eb2d17e4c9a9f.
Copyright 2025 xpzouying. Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
The upstream license is retained in third_party/xiaohongshu-mcp.LICENSE.

This adapter is a separate Python implementation. It does not run the upstream
server, bundled browser downloader, publication functions or unmerged draft PR.
The Python adapter is not an official Xiaohongshu integration and contains no publishing tools.

This distribution additionally includes an unmodified, locked source subset of
the upstream server in vendor/xiaohongshu-mcp for optional search and publication.
It is not enabled by the default MCP configuration. See upstream.lock.json and
vendor/xiaohongshu-mcp/NOTICE for its provenance.
